OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #700m to be cut from
OL,4,AScottish Budget next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #700m is to be cut from the
OL,7,FScottish government's Budget next year,
OL,8,Fthe country's official forecaster has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe Scottish Fiscal Commission (SFC)
OL,12,Fsaid the reduction - to correct the
OL,13,Fdifference between forecast and actual
OL,14,Fincome tax revenues - would lead to a
OL,15,Fdrop in funding for services.
OL,17,FIn its annual report, the body found
OL,18,Fthat Holyrood ministers had an extra
OL,19,F#831m to spend in the current financial
OL,20,Fyear compared with earlier forecasts,
OL,21,Flargely thanks to a one-off boost from
OL,22,Feducation spending south of the border.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
