OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #700m to be cut from
OL,4,AScottish Budget next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the SFC warned there was "very
OL,7,Flittle" new funding in 2027-28, coupled
OL,8,Fwith a worsening economic outlook,
OL,9,Fhigher inflation and weak household
OL,10,Fincome growth.
